# TEMPORARY PIN — remove when Debian LTS ships a fixed imagemagick (> deb11u16).
#
# bullseye-security imagemagick 8:6.9.11.60+dfsg-1.3+deb11u16 segfaults in the
# internal SVG (MSVG) coder on arm64: Imagick::readImageBlob() on any SVG dies
# with SIGSEGV, breaking the php_module_capabilities test in bullseye-based
# php*-cli images (same regression as bookworm deb12u12+). deb11u4 (bullseye
# main) is the newest version still in the regular archive that is not
# affected; intermediate versions exist only on snapshot.debian.org. If this
# pinned version disappears from the archive, apt falls back to the security
# version and the image test suite will catch it again.
Package: imagemagick-6-common libmagickcore-6.q16-6 libmagickcore-6.q16-6-extra libmagickwand-6.q16-6
Pin: version 8:6.9.11.60+dfsg-1.3+deb11u4
Pin-Priority: 1001
